WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.335
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.421
The Love Live final
preliminaries finally arrived.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.714
But it snowed heavily.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:08.133
We still have an hour before it starts.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.593
If we hurry, we can make it!

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:13.388
With modes of transportation out of order,
we lost our means of reaching the venue.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.639
Don't give up!

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:18.768
That's when our classmates
came to our rescue.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:20.103
Don't worry!

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.148
We'll help you get to the event!

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.150
Run as fast as you can!

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:30.030
And then we sang for our
chance to perform at Love Live.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.707
I missed it!

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.917
Who won? Red or white?

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.502
Pink...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.713
Pink?

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:52.427
Honoka, your friends are here.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:54.429
Happy new year!

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.181
Honoka.

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.932
It's not the new year yet.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:00.727
Huh? Then...have a good new year?

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.646
That's a parting expression.

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:06.066
Anyway, Honoka-chan, are you going to
your first shrine visit dressed like that?

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:09.152
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.864
Wait here. I'll go get changed.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.825
Whoops!

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:20.955
Honoka was herself till the very
last moment again this year.

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:25.627
I'm sure she'll be herself again next year, too.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:27.545
January 1

00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:31.341
It's the new year.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:35.095
No way!

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:41.267
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:48.858
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:55.907 --> 00:02:01.287
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:06.793
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:11.881
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:17.011
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:17.011 --> 00:02:22.517
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:28.398
<i>seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can</i>

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:31.234
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:36.823
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:41.619
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:47.792
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:52.839
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:58.136
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:58.136 --> 00:03:04.851
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:12.192
#10 - J's I can't believe the new
year started while I was changing...

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:14.736
It's your own fault for not getting ready.

00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:17.614
Don't start the new year being mad at me!

00:03:18.406 --> 00:03:19.073
Girls.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.326
Hanayo-chan, Rin-chan!

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:23.203
Happy new year.

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:24.329
Happy new year!

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:26.414
Let's have another good year!

00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:27.290
Yeah.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.542
Rin-chan, your clothes are so cute.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:30.794
Really?

00:03:33.004 --> 00:03:35.381
I got this for Christmas.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:36.966
It looks great on you, Rin-chan.

00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:38.426
Thanks!

00:03:39.177 --> 00:03:41.679
Maki-chan was here until a second ago...

00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:44.849
She went over there because
she was embarrassed.

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.393
Maki-chan?

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.863
Maki-chan, you're beautiful!

00:03:58.863 --> 00:03:59.739
How cute!

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:04.828
I-I wanted to wear my regular clothes,
but Mama made me wear this.

00:04:04.828 --> 00:04:07.205
Hey, why aren't any of you wearing one?

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:09.415
Were we supposed to?

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.292
Did we agree to do that?

00:04:11.292 --> 00:04:13.586
N-No, but...

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.462
Oh.

00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:15.755
It's you girls...

00:04:19.175 --> 00:04:20.385
I knew it.

00:04:24.138 --> 00:04:26.015
Happy new year.

00:04:26.391 --> 00:04:27.684
Happy new year.

00:04:27.684 --> 00:04:28.643
Are you headed to the shrine?

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:30.645
Yes. Were you just there?

00:04:30.645 --> 00:04:32.856
Yes. After all, it's our local shrine.

00:04:33.398 --> 00:04:34.774
Right.

00:04:42.824 --> 00:04:44.242
Well, we'll be going now.

00:04:56.504 --> 00:04:57.297
Hey.

00:04:58.131 --> 00:05:00.425
You'd better win Love Live.

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:07.140
We will!

00:05:28.786 --> 00:05:31.080
Kayo-chin, what did you ask for?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.457
It's a secret.

00:05:32.457 --> 00:05:33.458
What about you, Kotori-chan?

00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:35.627
To win Love Live, of course.

00:05:35.627 --> 00:05:37.003
Yeah.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.088
Come on. We're holding up the line.

00:05:39.088 --> 00:05:40.256
Let the next people...

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:43.426
Honoka?

00:05:45.553 --> 00:05:47.931
Honoka-chan, you're taking a long time.

00:05:47.931 --> 00:05:50.058
I bet you were making greedy wishes again.

00:05:50.058 --> 00:05:51.935
I was not.

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:56.230
I just wished for the nine of us to
have fun singing till the end.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.231
I see.

00:05:57.231 --> 00:05:58.942
But you're taking too long.

00:05:58.942 --> 00:06:01.277
But nothing's more important.

00:06:01.277 --> 00:06:04.656
That's why I'm praying so hard.

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:06.324
Huh? Where's Hanayo?

00:06:06.574 --> 00:06:07.617
Over there.

00:06:07.617 --> 00:06:09.786
Someone rescue me!

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:11.579
Hanayo-chan's getting swept away!

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:15.208
There she is. Nozomi-chan!

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:16.084
Oh, my.

00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:17.543
Happy new year.

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:18.544
Happy new year!

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.004
You seem busy.

00:06:20.964 --> 00:06:23.257
It's like this every year.

00:06:23.257 --> 00:06:26.010
But we have helpers this year.

00:06:26.928 --> 00:06:28.012
Nozomi!

00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:29.847
Does this go over there?

00:06:29.847 --> 00:06:30.974
Nico-chan!

00:06:31.599 --> 00:06:33.977
What? You're here?

00:06:34.852 --> 00:06:36.270
How cute!

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.064
You look good as a shrine maiden.

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.983
What? R-Really?

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:44.320
You could form a Japanese-style
duo with Maki-chan!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.530
A duo?

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.993
Welcome!

00:06:50.451 --> 00:06:51.160
That's it!

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.495
That's not it!

00:06:52.495 --> 00:06:54.038
Yeah, we're not a variety show act!

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:55.790
Oh, girls.

00:06:56.582 --> 00:06:57.917
Eli-chan!

00:06:57.917 --> 00:06:59.085
So cool!

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:01.045
Isn't she enchanting?

00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:03.131
Eli-chan, take a picture with me.

00:07:03.131 --> 00:07:05.800
I can't. I'm busy right now.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.385
Nozomi, hurry up.

00:07:07.385 --> 00:07:08.845
Okay, okay.

00:07:08.845 --> 00:07:09.762
See you later.

00:07:16.352 --> 00:07:18.146
They seem close.

00:07:18.146 --> 00:07:19.814
They're like sisters.

00:07:19.814 --> 00:07:24.235
But the third years have less
than three months, huh...

00:07:24.235 --> 00:07:30.616
Hanayo, we promised we wouldn't
talk about that until after Love Live.

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:32.785
I know, but...

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:37.790
We said we'd win Love Live for the sake of
the third years, and now we've come this far!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.542
Let's do our best until the very end!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:41.419
Yeah.

00:07:43.212 --> 00:07:45.089
Sis!

00:07:46.549 --> 00:07:50.011
Alisa, what did you ask for?

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:55.058
That I'll be accepted into
Otonokizaka High and get to join p's!

00:07:55.767 --> 00:07:56.976
Really?

00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:00.938
Okay, well Yukiho's waiting
for me, so I have to go.

00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:09.280
Maybe we should discuss the
future with everyone else.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.573
Yeah...

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:23.169
It's so cold... See you later.

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:24.504
Honoka!

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:25.963
Here.

00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:29.258
Your gloves were wet when
you came home last night.

00:08:29.717 --> 00:08:30.718
Thanks.

00:08:30.718 --> 00:08:33.137
See you later, then.

00:08:43.147 --> 00:08:44.398
So beautiful!

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:51.197
Good morning!

00:08:51.823 --> 00:08:54.700
Good morning. Here, we
gathered these documents.

00:08:54.951 --> 00:08:57.829
Sorry for making you do
that over winter break.

00:08:57.829 --> 00:08:59.956
We didn't have anything
to do anyway, so it's fine.

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:02.083
More importantly, do your best at Love Live!

00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:02.959
Okay!

00:09:05.628 --> 00:09:07.839
Unrestricted? Even our music selection?

00:09:07.839 --> 00:09:08.506
Yes.

00:09:08.506 --> 00:09:10.299
And it's not just the song.

00:09:10.299 --> 00:09:13.553
The outfits, choreography, and even
the length of song are all unrestricted.

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:17.682
Each representative will sing one song.

00:09:18.474 --> 00:09:23.187
And the audience at the event and online
will determine the winner. It's really simple.

00:09:23.521 --> 00:09:25.690
I think it's fine. It's easier to understand.

00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:31.821
And now, all the remaining groups in the
competition are saying it's important to

00:09:31.821 --> 00:09:33.447
create an impression before the main event...

00:09:33.948 --> 00:09:35.158
Creating an impression?

00:09:35.575 --> 00:09:39.579
About 50 groups will each be singing a song.

00:09:39.579 --> 00:09:43.916
Naturally, we can't assume that every
viewer will remember every song.

00:09:44.167 --> 00:09:49.338
On top of that, a lot of people will only
be watching certain groups online.

00:09:49.338 --> 00:09:53.217
That's true. Watching all of the
groups at once might be difficult.

00:09:53.718 --> 00:09:58.055
M's is receiving attention,
because we beat A-RISE.

00:09:58.055 --> 00:10:01.559
As of now, we stand out more
than most groups, but...

00:10:01.559 --> 00:10:06.731
But who knows what might happen
by the main event in March...

00:10:06.731 --> 00:10:07.231
Yes.

00:10:07.231 --> 00:10:11.319
But is there a way to create an
impression before the event?

00:10:11.319 --> 00:10:14.697
Yes. The most important of those is...

00:10:14.697 --> 00:10:16.199
A catch phrase?

00:10:16.199 --> 00:10:21.746
Yes. Participating groups can write a
catch phrase on their introduction page.

00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:22.705
For example...

00:10:22.705 --> 00:10:24.165
"Imps of love."

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.750
"Elegant idols."

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.168
"With you."

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.713
I see. Everyone's thinking really hard.

00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:34.175
Naturally, we should come up with one, too.

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:38.179
Yes. Something that expresses the
essence of J's in a word or phrase...

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:41.265
M's in one word, huh?

00:10:43.226 --> 00:10:45.686
M's, M's...

00:10:45.686 --> 00:10:46.771
We're not hair mousse!

00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:47.813
That's obvious.

00:10:48.606 --> 00:10:49.357
Nine?

00:10:49.357 --> 00:10:50.775
That's obvious, too.

00:10:50.775 --> 00:10:53.402
Umi-chan, help me think!

00:10:53.402 --> 00:10:55.404
I know, but...

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.823
It's pretty hard.

00:10:57.823 --> 00:11:01.661
Our personalities are all different, and we
didn't even come together all at once.

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:05.248
But we all want to win Love Live!

00:11:05.665 --> 00:11:07.792
That would make our catch phrase...

00:11:08.251 --> 00:11:10.544
"We'll win Love Live!"

00:11:11.796 --> 00:11:12.964
Who do we think we are?

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:15.841
Huh?

00:11:20.388 --> 00:11:21.597
Tsubasa-san...

00:11:26.143 --> 00:11:27.353
We need to talk.

00:11:32.191 --> 00:11:33.609
Love Live!

00:11:40.449 --> 00:11:45.913
I'm sorry, but I just had to
talk to you, leader to leader.

00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:50.835
It's okay. I'm sure Umi-chan
and Kotori-chan understand.

00:11:51.419 --> 00:11:53.087
Are you practicing hard?

00:11:53.087 --> 00:11:59.302
Yes. Everyone knows we have to put on a
performance that won't embarrass A-RISE.

00:11:59.885 --> 00:12:00.636
I see.

00:12:03.806 --> 00:12:06.017
Um, is A-RISE...?

00:12:06.017 --> 00:12:09.145
Don't worry, we're still practicing.

00:12:09.145 --> 00:12:13.816
I wasn't sure what would happen
without having Love Live as our goal,

00:12:13.816 --> 00:12:16.902
but we all love singing.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.654
I'm glad...

00:12:18.654 --> 00:12:22.908
But I just had to ask you...

00:12:24.285 --> 00:12:28.289
At the final preliminary, we
sang with everything we had.

00:12:30.708 --> 00:12:32.752
And we accept our defeat.

00:12:34.295 --> 00:12:39.383
I have no hard feelings about that.

00:12:41.177 --> 00:12:43.304
At least, that's what I thought.

00:12:43.304 --> 00:12:43.846
Huh?

00:12:45.348 --> 00:12:49.060
I can't stop wondering why we lost.

00:12:51.062 --> 00:12:53.064
...see.

00:12:53.356 --> 00:12:55.191
I don't understand why.

00:12:55.191 --> 00:13:00.112
M's grasped the hearts of
the fans more than we did.

00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:02.406
Your performance was splendid, as well.

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:06.243
We knew, even before the
results were announced.

00:13:08.579 --> 00:13:10.539
But how did you do that?

00:13:10.539 --> 00:13:11.499
Huh?

00:13:11.999 --> 00:13:16.545
I'm sure you worked hard,
and I can tell you practiced.

00:13:16.545 --> 00:13:18.255
Your teamwork is good, too.

00:13:18.756 --> 00:13:21.759
But in that regard, we're the same.

00:13:22.134 --> 00:13:26.097
If anything, we tried to be stronger than you.

00:13:26.555 --> 00:13:29.642
That was A-RISE's pride. Our style.

00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:31.519
That's why we shouldn't have lost.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:33.854
That's what I thought.

00:13:34.438 --> 00:13:35.648
But we lost.

00:13:36.774 --> 00:13:38.484
I want to know the reason.

00:13:38.859 --> 00:13:41.695
What is the thing that motivates p's?

00:13:41.695 --> 00:13:45.533
What is the driving force that supports you?

00:13:46.909 --> 00:13:48.494
What is it?

00:13:49.787 --> 00:13:51.622
That's what I wanted to ask.

00:13:53.624 --> 00:13:54.834
Uh, um...

00:13:57.586 --> 00:13:59.588
Uh, well...

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:03.759
I'm sorry! I'm not sure.

00:14:09.014 --> 00:14:10.683
Thanks for today.

00:14:10.683 --> 00:14:14.019
I'm sorry I couldn't answer your question.

00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:15.563
Don't worry about it.

00:14:15.563 --> 00:14:19.692
But I think we only made it
this far because of A-RISE.

00:14:27.074 --> 00:14:30.828
The driving force that motivates p's?

00:14:30.828 --> 00:14:34.248
Yeah. I couldn't answer her question.

00:14:34.748 --> 00:14:36.625
What do you think it is, Umi-chan?

00:14:37.209 --> 00:14:40.296
I see. That's a difficult question.

00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:43.424
But that just may be our catch phrase.

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:44.091
Huh?

00:14:44.758 --> 00:14:47.303
The word that expresses the essence of J's.

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:51.515
It's probably the driving force behind p's.

00:14:52.099 --> 00:14:53.309
I see.

00:14:55.352 --> 00:14:56.729
Are you studying here?

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:58.481
Yeah. My room's cold.

00:14:58.481 --> 00:15:00.232
I'm taking a bath first.

00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:01.025
Go ahead.

00:15:03.444 --> 00:15:07.281
Hey, Yukiho, how do you see ['s?

00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:09.700
What? Where did that come from?

00:15:11.869 --> 00:15:13.037
Well...

00:15:13.871 --> 00:15:14.705
With concern?

00:15:14.705 --> 00:15:15.789
What?

00:15:15.789 --> 00:15:20.085
Then there's shaky, unreliable,
and suspenseful.

00:15:20.711 --> 00:15:22.630
You know, we are the
regional representatives.

00:15:22.922 --> 00:15:27.384
I know, but I can't help but worry about you.

00:15:27.384 --> 00:15:28.928
Is that so?

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:31.013
Then, why do you think we won?

00:15:31.013 --> 00:15:32.848
- Who knows?
- Who knows?

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:38.729
But for some reason, I feel like I have to
support you more than any other group.

00:15:38.729 --> 00:15:42.691
And not because you're my
sister or the local group.

00:15:42.691 --> 00:15:45.194
You have to support us, huh?

00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:49.907
You have my support!
Do your best at Love Live.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.621
Wh-What?

00:15:55.996 --> 00:15:58.707
I forgot something important!

00:15:58.707 --> 00:15:59.750
Where's Mom?

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.460
In the kitchen.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.754
Mom!

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:07.341
What's with her?

00:16:07.591 --> 00:16:09.051
Japanese Sweets
Homura

00:16:09.051 --> 00:16:10.761
Thanks for waiting.

00:16:14.598 --> 00:16:15.516
Festival

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.018
Are you sure you can do it, Honoka?

00:16:18.394 --> 00:16:20.354
Dad taught me how.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.400
Here we go!

00:16:24.692 --> 00:16:25.276
Okay.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.245
The rice was so shiny!

00:16:36.245 --> 00:16:37.580
It's mochi!

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:38.956
You're ready to eat.

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:41.166
Rin-chan, wanna try?

00:16:41.166 --> 00:16:42.167
Yeah!

00:16:42.459 --> 00:16:43.794
Maki-chan, you, too.

00:16:43.794 --> 00:16:45.087
I'll pass.

00:16:45.087 --> 00:16:47.464
Anyway, why are you pounding mochi?

00:16:47.464 --> 00:16:48.674
Are you disposing of inventory?

00:16:48.966 --> 00:16:55.806
No. I realized we hadn't done
anything to thank our classmates.

00:16:55.806 --> 00:16:56.682
Thank them?

00:16:56.682 --> 00:17:01.353
Yeah. Isn't it because of them that we
made it through the final preliminaries?

00:17:01.353 --> 00:17:05.649
But then winter break started,
and New Year's came.

00:17:05.899 --> 00:17:08.736
Yeah, but that doesn't mean
we have to give them mochi.

00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:11.530
I couldn't think of anything else.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:16.452
Besides, I feel like I'll be struck with our
catch phrase when I see everyone at school.

00:17:16.452 --> 00:17:17.661
Struck with?

00:17:17.661 --> 00:17:19.413
Like the way you're striking the mochi!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.958
Nico-chan, that was lame.

00:17:22.958 --> 00:17:25.753
Sorry! I couldn't help it!

00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:28.422
Watch out!

00:17:29.632 --> 00:17:31.425
I can't let y's get hurt!

00:17:32.134 --> 00:17:33.427
Alisa...

00:17:36.055 --> 00:17:38.641
I wasn't trying to hit her.

00:17:39.183 --> 00:17:41.685
Mochi? Is it slime?

00:17:41.685 --> 00:17:43.896
Try some. It's delicious.

00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:49.068
It's good!

00:17:50.653 --> 00:17:51.570
You went all out with this.

00:17:52.529 --> 00:17:53.906
Welcome!

00:17:56.617 --> 00:17:58.077
Here you go.

00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:00.037
There's enough for everyone!

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:05.626
Would you like soy sauce or soybean flour?

00:18:05.626 --> 00:18:09.213
Line up, everyone. The
mochi isn't going anywhere.

00:18:10.422 --> 00:18:11.548
Wow.

00:18:11.548 --> 00:18:13.008
That's amazing!

00:18:13.008 --> 00:18:14.551
Ready, and...

00:18:14.551 --> 00:18:17.179
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:18:17.471 --> 00:18:20.391
This is soybean flour? How strange...

00:18:20.391 --> 00:18:22.351
Kayo-chin, you'll get fat.

00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:23.769
My mochi!

00:18:32.528 --> 00:18:34.947
I'm glad everyone came.

00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:37.908
Despite it being the middle of
winter break, a lot of people came.

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:40.577
Does everyone love mochi that much?

00:18:40.577 --> 00:18:42.454
Of course they do. It's delicious.

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:45.749
It's because they all feel the same way.

00:18:45.749 --> 00:18:46.458
Huh?

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:49.044
There's them, and there's us.

00:18:49.044 --> 00:18:50.462
That's why.

00:18:50.713 --> 00:18:52.423
I think I understand.

00:18:52.423 --> 00:18:54.007
But not really...

00:18:54.007 --> 00:18:55.843
Is that our catch phrase?

00:18:57.177 --> 00:18:58.721
It's right here.

00:18:59.638 --> 00:19:02.224
It's true! I'm close!

00:19:02.224 --> 00:19:05.644
I feel like I'm about to have
an "Ah-ha!" moment.

00:19:14.194 --> 00:19:15.404
I can't run anymore!

00:19:15.404 --> 00:19:16.196
Me, neither.

00:19:16.697 --> 00:19:19.616
Okay, you worked hard. Take a break.

00:19:23.954 --> 00:19:27.249
Honoka and Kotori, you're
done, too. Good work.

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:31.754
This is tough after pounding mochi.

00:19:31.754 --> 00:19:34.089
But Honoka, you set a new personal record.

00:19:35.424 --> 00:19:36.550
Really?

00:19:37.384 --> 00:19:38.385
Yes!

00:19:57.029 --> 00:19:58.739
I wish to save up money
- Kujo Mio

00:19:59.823 --> 00:20:01.241
There are so many.

00:20:01.241 --> 00:20:02.743
It is just after New Year's.

00:20:04.745 --> 00:20:07.998
This one's by an Otonokizaka High student.

00:20:08.332 --> 00:20:09.291
So is this one.

00:20:09.792 --> 00:20:11.502
I wish for p's to put on the greatest concert
at Love Live! You can do it! I love p's! - E.N.

00:20:12.127 --> 00:20:12.753
Look.

00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:17.466
I wish for p's to not be late to the concert.

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:20.135
I wish for clear skies on
the day of the concert.

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:26.099
Shaky, unreliable, and suspenseful.

00:20:26.809 --> 00:20:29.102
I can't help but worry about you.

00:20:29.561 --> 00:20:31.772
I can't let y's get hurt!

00:20:37.236 --> 00:20:38.487
That's it...

00:20:39.154 --> 00:20:40.239
I've got it!

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:41.615
That's it! This is it!

00:20:41.615 --> 00:20:42.407
What?

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:43.784
Where did this come from?

00:20:44.284 --> 00:20:45.953
The driving force behind p's!

00:20:45.953 --> 00:20:47.788
The reason we work so hard!

00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:48.747
The reason we've all worked so hard!

00:20:49.331 --> 00:20:50.874
This is p's!

00:20:50.874 --> 00:20:52.000
This?

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:52.626
Yeah!

00:20:52.626 --> 00:20:56.839
We work our hardest, and the
people who watch us support us!

00:20:56.839 --> 00:20:58.674
And we grow together!

00:20:58.674 --> 00:21:00.050
That's everything!

00:21:00.592 --> 00:21:02.803
Everyone's working hard
with the same feelings.

00:21:03.262 --> 00:21:07.224
We move forward together, and little
by little, our dreams come true.

00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:09.852
That's what a school idol is all about!

00:21:09.852 --> 00:21:11.687
That's y's!

00:21:17.276 --> 00:21:19.319
Everyone's strength...

00:21:19.611 --> 00:21:21.572
That's W's...

00:21:24.449 --> 00:21:26.285
You can do it, p's!

00:21:44.469 --> 00:21:45.721
Ibanebakko

00:21:45.721 --> 00:21:50.767
Lemon Milk
A Sweet and Sour Chemical Reaction

00:21:50.767 --> 00:21:53.437
Bridge of Color

00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:04.239
A Story

00:22:04.239 --> 00:22:05.782
Achieved

00:22:05.782 --> 00:22:07.534
Together

00:22:07.534 --> 00:22:11.455
A Story Achieved Together

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:20.797
ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.797 --> 00:22:26.553
sabishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:29.848
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.848 --> 00:22:32.809
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.809 --> 00:22:36.813
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:43.946
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi! Go, go')</i>

00:22:43.946 --> 00:22:51.411
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:59.670
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.509
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.509 --> 00:23:12.557
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.557 --> 00:23:21.608
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:32.536
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.747 --> 00:23:39.543
